<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP FOUR QUALIFYING RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP FOUR QUALIFYING RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Cup Asian zone</p>
<p>group four qualifying matches played in Tokyo on Sunday:</p>
<p>Oman 6 Nepal 0 (halftime 3-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Raju Kaji Shakya 1 own goal, Said al-Busaidi 13,</p>
<p>Ahmed Ali Hassan 17, 50, Mohammed al-Araimi 73, Badar</p>
<p>al-Mahrouqi 78</p>
</text>
